    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1577">

                <pb facs="1319" n="1215" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1215"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 72.3.2515/254.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to Chile to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santiago, Chile</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-11-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 30, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram of November 9. Senate yesterday passed without debate law providing
                    for representation of Tacna-Arica in the Chilean Congress.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
